OL,3,GNEWSAMan seriously injured in Glasgow
OL,4,Asouthside stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are investigating after a man
OL,7,Fwas stabbed in the southside of
OL,8,FGlasgow.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to a
OL,11,Fserious assault on Glenmuir Drive in
OL,12,Fthe Priesthill area of the city at
OL,13,Fabout 20:00 on Friday.
OL,15,FHe was taken to hospital for treatment,
OL,16,Fbut his condition is currently unknown.
OL,18,FThe street was cordoned off and a force
OL,19,Fspokesperson said inquiries were
OL,20,Fongoing.
